      "text": "They use their tusks to crush the berries they eat. Repeated regrowth makes their tusks strong and sharp.",
      "version": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "They mark their territory by leaving gashes in trees with their tusks. If a tusk breaks, a new one grows in quickly.",
